WEBVTT

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:05.380
<i>Dragunov and Liselotte, 
after sneaking into Cyfandir</i>

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:07.760
<i>in pursuit of Seth and his companions,</i>

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:10.870
<i>received a new secret order 
from General Torque</i>

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:13.510
<i>and paid a visit to a strange man.</i>

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:18.850
<i>The man was Doussant, 
one of the Merchant Barons.</i>

00:00:19.550 --> 00:00:22.350
<i>The truth behind the conspiracy 
unfolding in this land</i>

00:00:22.350 --> 00:00:24.140
<i>is on its way to being revealed.</i>

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:28.260
New orders after we sneak 
into the target location?

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.450
What could this be about?

00:00:30.950 --> 00:00:34.620
And they sure picked 
a weird place for us to go.

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:41.010
They're either being very careful 
or feeling very guilty.

00:00:41.470 --> 00:00:44.980
Regardless, it's a direct order 
from General Torque.

00:00:45.430 --> 00:00:47.230
Hey, Dragunov...

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:51.650
When General Torque said 
you were to become a Thaumaturge,

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:54.990
you didn't seem very enthusiastic.

00:00:55.300 --> 00:00:57.520
That's not true at all.

00:00:57.520 --> 00:00:59.990
We all express joy in different ways.

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:07.810
Ah, we're so glad you're here.

00:01:07.810 --> 00:01:10.000
Sorry this location 
is so out of the way.

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:16.130
Captain Liselotte and Captain Dragunov 
of the Thaumaturges, correct?

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:56.030
<b>Your Decision 
-Knighthood-</b>

00:02:51.870 --> 00:02:53.410
<i>"Your Decision."</i>

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:58.660
Captain Dragunov!

00:02:58.660 --> 00:03:04.160
I never dreamed a man of your renown 
would visit us as a secret emissary.

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:07.410
And accompanied by Captain Liselotte, no less.

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:11.040
Enough flattery. 
What is your business with us?

00:03:12.540 --> 00:03:15.350
You've troubled two Thaumaturges with this.

00:03:15.350 --> 00:03:17.940
If it turns out to be
 a trivial matter, you will pay.

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:25.160
I call it the "Harmonizium."

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:26.790
What are you talking about?

00:03:26.790 --> 00:03:31.190
The ground-breaking device 
that nullifies Fantasia.

00:03:32.460 --> 00:03:35.300
If the sorcerers can be rendered powerless,

00:03:35.300 --> 00:03:41.070
it will be a simple matter 
for your Inquisition to intervene.

00:03:41.430 --> 00:03:43.070
What are you getting at?

00:03:43.070 --> 00:03:46.080
I'm speaking of an armed intervention.

00:03:46.470 --> 00:03:48.990
You're suggesting 
that we should wage war?

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:51.610
This is a nation of infected people,

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:56.810
a land of savages that obstructs 
the Inquisition's rule. Is it not?

00:03:56.810 --> 00:04:02.520
I'm sure General Torque doesn't 
want them running free forever.

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:04.010
You have a point.

00:04:04.010 --> 00:04:08.820
If we could intervene in this land, 
our dignity would surely be restored.

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:10.290
Indeed.

00:04:10.290 --> 00:04:14.560
What happened in Rumble Town 
was a crippling blow to the Inquisition.

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:19.910
Hmph. As if a Merchant Baron has any idea.

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:24.320
Please, give this report to General Torque.

00:04:24.320 --> 00:04:27.250
Victory will assure a wealth 
of resources for us

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:32.510
and a restoration of dignity 
and good faith for you.

00:04:32.510 --> 00:04:34.830
Let us work together.

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:37.960
We will await your favorable reply.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:44.220
You certainly are a smooth talker.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:47.970
Did I say anything that upset you?

00:04:47.970 --> 00:04:50.540
You mentioned resources.

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:52.340
Tell me what you really meant.

00:04:54.670 --> 00:04:58.860
I can see how you earned 
General Torque's trust.

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:01.450
Out of respect to your keen insight,

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:03.360
I will tell you.

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:07.610
Our true objective is...

00:05:07.610 --> 00:05:12.320
to use the device to render all the infected 
in this nation powerless

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:16.120
and make them our slaves.

00:05:23.030 --> 00:05:25.280
<i>Meanwhile, Ocoho had begun to suspect</i>

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:31.890
<i>that the one using her curse to make 
the Spectre Nemesis appear was Mordred,</i>

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:36.630
<i>so she visited his room 
to find out the truth.</i>

00:05:39.270 --> 00:05:41.020
Come to think of it...

00:05:41.500 --> 00:05:45.010
I saw you with him 
in the stables a while back.

00:05:46.130 --> 00:05:51.030
Then your eyes went hollow, 
just the way they were earlier.

00:05:53.060 --> 00:05:53.910
Yes?

00:05:56.970 --> 00:05:59.830
Ocoho? What are you doing here so late?

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:02.260
This is the men's dorm, you know?

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:06.110
We need to talk.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:09.930
Come in.

00:06:20.610 --> 00:06:26.290
I have offered up my life 
to Cyfandir and its people!

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:30.780
Mordred, I thought 
it was the same for you!

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:35.410
C-Calm down! 
It <i>is</i> the same for me!

00:06:35.410 --> 00:06:36.530
Shut up!

00:06:38.540 --> 00:06:40.630
You're saying the way 
you could serve this country

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:42.540
was to summon Spectre Nemesis?!

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:45.420
T-To protect this country...

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:46.800
Don't give me that!

00:06:46.800 --> 00:06:50.910
It's the Spectres that are hurting the people 
we're supposed to protect!

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:53.970
But still... I...

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:55.310
Please, just trust me!

00:06:55.310 --> 00:06:58.330
I <i>did</i> trust you! More than anyone!

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:01.250
That's why... Mordred...

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:05.320
I told you, and only you, 
my secret about my curse!

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:08.380
So... why?

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:11.020
Why did you use me?!

00:07:12.380 --> 00:07:15.090
T-To protect you.

00:07:15.090 --> 00:07:16.310
Shut up!

00:07:16.780 --> 00:07:18.740
Stop making up lies!

00:07:18.740 --> 00:07:20.620
I-It's true!

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:26.230
Th-The Faithful of the Hermit 
wanted to use you as an assassin.

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:27.510
What do you mean?

00:07:27.940 --> 00:07:29.090
Tell me!

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:33.470
The Faithful of the Hermit...

00:07:33.810 --> 00:07:36.220
wanted to use your curse to eliminate

00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:40.060
Knights-sorcerers who betrayed the great Merlin

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:43.600
and farmers who trade with foreigners.

00:07:44.300 --> 00:07:48.490
But because you're important to me, 
I couldn't let them do that.

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:50.990
So I called the Spectres. It's true!

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:52.220
That won't work.

00:07:52.810 --> 00:07:57.380
I can't believe anything you say now!

00:08:00.570 --> 00:08:02.600
I have to tell the queen.

00:08:02.600 --> 00:08:06.650
I know the queen will listen to me.

00:08:06.650 --> 00:08:08.640
You don't want to do that.

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:09.510
Huh?

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:14.260
To become a Faithful of the Hermit, 
a disciple of the great Merlin,

00:08:14.790 --> 00:08:18.550
one must swear loyalty to the queen.

00:08:18.550 --> 00:08:20.790
You understand what that means, don't you?

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:34.660
Great Merlin,

00:08:35.550 --> 00:08:40.500
founder of Caislean Merlin 
and our great guardian...

00:08:41.050 --> 00:08:43.310
Please give me your guidance.

00:08:43.970 --> 00:08:46.540
Please lend me your strength.

00:08:47.660 --> 00:08:51.800
What kind of strength 
do you think a rock like that has?

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:52.590
Huh?

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:57.820
Myr! Wh-Why are you suddenly here?

00:08:57.820 --> 00:09:00.810
I'm asking the great Merlin for help.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.450
Oh?

00:09:02.450 --> 00:09:06.780
So this "Merlin" is a giant hunk of stone?

00:09:06.780 --> 00:09:08.210
No!

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:11.820
This is a statue 
made in his image, obviously!

00:09:12.180 --> 00:09:15.270
Well, then, no matter how much 
you pray to this thing,

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:17.850
it won't be of any help to you.

00:09:18.740 --> 00:09:21.830
Don't you agree?

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:26.080
Seth?! Why are you here?

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:28.570
After spending all that time in the forest,

00:09:28.570 --> 00:09:30.580
I couldn't sleep in that bed.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:34.310
So, what happened with Marmot?

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:38.970
I see.

00:09:40.940 --> 00:09:42.590
You know, when I was little...

00:09:43.730 --> 00:09:49.150
my friends and I saw the Knights-sorcerers 
flying overhead on their dragons.

00:09:49.770 --> 00:09:51.490
They looked so cool.

00:09:51.490 --> 00:09:53.870
We decided that when we grew up,

00:09:53.870 --> 00:09:57.020
we were going to be strong knights 
who would protect this country.

00:09:57.710 --> 00:10:01.450
So we worked hard together 
all these years...

00:10:02.190 --> 00:10:05.020
But the friend I was chasing that dream with

00:10:05.470 --> 00:10:07.790
called forth the Spectre Nemesis.

00:10:08.900 --> 00:10:12.430
And the queen I respected 
was giving them their orders.

00:10:15.230 --> 00:10:17.500
We're so close to the 
ordination ceremony, too.

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:19.210
What am I supposed to believe?

00:10:19.910 --> 00:10:24.560
When I thought about that, 
my feet carried me here on their own.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:27.930
I wondered what the great Merlin 
would have done.

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:30.520
You want to know?

00:10:30.520 --> 00:10:34.680
Merlin wouldn't have asked a rock for help.

00:10:34.680 --> 00:10:35.740
Myr...

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:38.540
You're right.

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:44.250
I don't know if I can protect Cyfandir anymore.

00:10:44.250 --> 00:10:45.950
You can protect anything.

00:10:46.890 --> 00:10:51.460
You stood up to an army of Nemesis 
all by yourself.

00:10:51.870 --> 00:10:54.170
Anyone else would've chickened out.

00:10:54.170 --> 00:10:55.940
Even if no one praises you for it,

00:10:55.940 --> 00:10:57.840
even if no one recognizes you for it,

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:00.740
you stuck with it 
in order to protect everyone.

00:11:02.970 --> 00:11:04.700
So be proud!

00:11:04.700 --> 00:11:07.200
Even if you don't have the title of knight,

00:11:07.200 --> 00:11:08.780
you're still you, right?

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:15.980
So just do what you think is right, 
based on what you see and feel.

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:25.060
What I think is right...

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:39.010
<b>[The Ordination Ceremony] 
In this ceremony, Knight-sorcerers welcome knight apprentice
 as their own children. In recent years, knight apprentices have been few in number,
 so all of them have been welcomed by a family.</b>

00:11:40.900 --> 00:11:45.550
<b>The Day of the Ordination Ceremony</b>

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:45.550
For crying out loud...

00:11:45.550 --> 00:11:48.060
This is such a stupid idea.

00:11:48.060 --> 00:11:49.810
What is?

00:11:49.810 --> 00:11:51.950
These outfits!

00:11:51.950 --> 00:11:54.660
We have to dress up as sorcerers, 
of all things?

00:11:55.150 --> 00:11:57.370
All for the sake of our mission.

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:01.970
We could've gotten through easily 
without the disguises.

00:12:01.970 --> 00:12:06.070
They're not inspecting anyone. 
There aren't even any guards around.

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:08.670
Still, it's already time, eh?

00:12:09.410 --> 00:12:13.080
This plan is moving along shockingly well.

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:16.690
The Merchant Barons are a shady bunch,

00:12:16.690 --> 00:12:19.590
but it seems they actually 
have everything worked out.

00:12:19.590 --> 00:12:20.850
Yeah.

00:12:20.850 --> 00:12:25.480
And this is all the result 
of the settlement you reached with them.

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:28.720
Your actions in these past several weeks 
have been admirable.

00:12:28.720 --> 00:12:30.970
Even General Torque praised you.

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:47.590
Is that...

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:52.750
Look! It's Ocoho!

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:54.060
Oh, yeah!

00:12:57.750 --> 00:13:00.420
Ocoho looks so gallant!

00:13:01.220 --> 00:13:04.260
But she also looks a bit nervous.

00:13:05.450 --> 00:13:06.380
<i>Ocoho.</i>

00:13:06.380 --> 00:13:08.490
<i>Ocoho, you okay?</i>

00:13:09.820 --> 00:13:10.780
<i>Seth?</i>

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:16.020
I know you're probably worried 
about this ordination, but...

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:18.400
I'm not worried about that.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:22.450
I might not become a Knight-sorcerer,

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:25.900
but I know what it is 
that I need to do.

00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:27.610
I see.

00:13:27.610 --> 00:13:29.090
I'm going now, okay?

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:30.180
Good luck.

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:31.390
Same to you.

00:13:51.180 --> 00:13:54.180
Adorable knight apprentices,

00:13:54.180 --> 00:13:57.260
protectors of Cyfandir...

00:13:57.810 --> 00:14:03.940
Today, you will be welcomed 
into your new families.

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:05.340
Your Highness!

00:14:08.950 --> 00:14:11.900
It seems that some of the most promising talents

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:16.950
in Caislean Merlin's history 
are among this year's apprentices.

00:14:17.860 --> 00:14:19.940
I am so proud of you.

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:25.600
Always remember the teachings 
of the great Merlin.

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:29.750
Stand together before the sacred tree 
that has survived the flames of war,

00:14:29.750 --> 00:14:33.850
and let us spare a thought for the events 
of the past as we celebrate.

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:38.350
Now, Knights-sorcerers of Cyfandir!

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:42.110
Choose the ones who will inherit 
the great Merlin's legacy!

00:14:42.110 --> 00:14:44.380
What are the apprentices' names?

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:48.330
<i>Meanwhile, Seth and Doc</i>

00:14:48.330 --> 00:14:50.830
<i>had slipped into the basement library.</i>

00:14:52.060 --> 00:14:55.870
There aren't many guards during the ceremony, 
just as Ocoho said.

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:58.650
Why did I have to come with you?

00:14:59.100 --> 00:15:01.570
You said you wanted to see the books 
in the archive, didn't you?

00:15:01.570 --> 00:15:04.940
Right now, I value my life
 more than my research!

00:15:04.940 --> 00:15:07.530
If we're caught, 
the charges against us will be severe!

00:15:07.530 --> 00:15:10.450
I don't want to cross 
any more dangerous bridges!

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:12.330
In fact, I'm leaving right now!

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:13.110
Doc!

00:15:14.350 --> 00:15:16.210
We're fine as long as we don't get caught.

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:19.530
You take care of the thing 
Grimm asked for, okay?

00:15:19.530 --> 00:15:20.890
Huh?!

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:24.170
See ya. You can do whatever you want 
after you find it.

00:15:24.170 --> 00:15:25.550
Wait, Seth!

00:15:26.350 --> 00:15:28.340
W-Will you be okay?

00:15:28.340 --> 00:15:32.160
I mean, if that Diabal guy calls a Spectre...

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:35.940
I think if I talk to him, 
I might learn something.

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:39.160
Such as why I have this power.

00:15:40.470 --> 00:15:41.170
Later.

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:42.170
H-Hey!

00:15:43.330 --> 00:15:44.690
Sheesh...

00:15:48.570 --> 00:15:54.010
These are our new Knights-sorcerers.

00:16:00.740 --> 00:16:02.130
Ocoho...

00:16:03.440 --> 00:16:05.690
How troubling.

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:10.320
Is there no one who wishes 
to make this girl their successor?

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:12.830
With all due respect, Your Highness,

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:18.140
the many violations of orders 
this girl has committed are unforgivable.

00:16:18.140 --> 00:16:20.950
Am I wrong, Lord Brangoire?

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:27.210
We are responsible for protecting this land.

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:33.470
Accepting such an out-of-control successor 
would ruin everything for us.

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:40.470
I understand how you all feel.

00:16:40.470 --> 00:16:44.570
Still, might I ask you 
to please reconsider?

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:48.820
Your Highness, it's all right.

00:16:50.050 --> 00:16:52.240
What does that mean?

00:16:52.820 --> 00:16:56.670
I don't need the title of Knight-sorcerer.

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:02.870
I understand your frustration.

00:17:02.870 --> 00:17:07.610
However, you must not insult 
such an honored title.

00:17:07.610 --> 00:17:10.250
The only one who's insulted that honored title

00:17:10.790 --> 00:17:14.130
is you, Your Highness!

00:17:14.570 --> 00:17:17.010
You set the Spectres on your people!

00:17:17.770 --> 00:17:19.510
Excuse me?

00:17:19.510 --> 00:17:22.000
What's she talking about?

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:24.530
The queen's been summoning the Spectres?

00:17:24.530 --> 00:17:25.890
Impossible!

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:29.400
I brought forth the Spectres?

00:17:30.070 --> 00:17:32.890
That's an accusation 
I certainly didn't expect.

00:17:32.890 --> 00:17:36.650
But I haven't the time 
for such jokes right now—

00:17:36.650 --> 00:17:37.690
No!

00:17:37.690 --> 00:17:42.910
This is exactly the right time 
to ask you to explain yourself!

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:45.070
In order to protect my comrades!

00:17:47.130 --> 00:17:49.790
People of Cyfandir, listen to me!

00:17:49.790 --> 00:17:53.200
The Spectres do not occur naturally!

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:53.200
What?

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:55.130
What's she talking about?

00:17:53.660 --> 00:17:59.130
The Spectre Nemesis are created by a group 
called the Faithful of the Hermit!

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:04.410
The Faithful of the Hermit

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:10.080
tried to rule through fear 
by hurting you with Spectre Nemesis,

00:18:10.080 --> 00:18:12.400
all to protect this country 
from foreign threats.

00:18:13.090 --> 00:18:16.780
But I don't believe that's right!

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:19.990
So I'm presenting this charge here and now!

00:18:20.660 --> 00:18:23.550
The Faithful of the Hermit's base is here,

00:18:23.550 --> 00:18:26.050
in the heart of Caislean Merlin!

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:29.920
That is quite enough, little girl!

00:18:29.920 --> 00:18:33.670
What are you doing?! 
Guards, restrain her!

00:18:38.060 --> 00:18:39.180
Gysoni!

00:18:41.300 --> 00:18:42.640
This is...

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:45.390
Such a powerful Gysoni...

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:49.760
<i>The only ones it wasn't cast on 
are the experienced Knights-sorcerers.</i>

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:52.820
<i>Even I might fall under its influence 
if I'm not careful!</i>

00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:01.600
What marvelous power.

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:04.780
Everything you do surprises me.

00:19:04.780 --> 00:19:08.160
Your Highness, 
please give me an honest answer!

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:11.420
You never hide anything 
from your people, right?

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:15.130
The citizens that we need
 to protect are right here!

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:19.140
Now, don't hide the truth! 
Tell us everything!

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:23.430
B-Be at ease!

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:26.860
Good people of Cyfandir!

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:31.440
There is no need to listen 
to this foolish girl!

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:37.940
She is only trying to pull a prank 
in retaliation for not being chosen!

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:42.370
I swear to all the people here 
that I speak the truth!

00:19:42.370 --> 00:19:45.330
What about you, Lord de Gulis?

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:48.300
Can you swear 
that what you say is true?!

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:50.250
Silence!

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:55.430
Problem children like you must be punished!

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:03.320
Lord Brangoire!

00:20:03.320 --> 00:20:05.580
What is the meaning of this?!

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:08.350
You are acting quite rashly, Lord de Gulis.

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:13.270
Your behavior tells me that
 you have played a part in this scheme!

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:16.680
And it isn't only Lord de Gulis!

00:20:16.680 --> 00:20:21.860
Knights-sorcerers! 
Who among you have been deceiving the people?!

00:20:26.120 --> 00:20:30.120
Hmph. Looks like 
it's about one fourth of you.

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:31.620
Citizens!

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:36.250
What this girl says is lamentable, but true!

00:20:36.250 --> 00:20:38.500
I will vouch for her!

00:20:42.010 --> 00:20:47.730
Brangoire, this is not a matter 
you should speak of publicly.

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:51.820
Are you trying to upset 
my people purely for fun?

00:20:51.820 --> 00:20:54.090
With all due respect, Your Highness,

00:20:54.090 --> 00:20:58.400
I cannot comply with your commands any longer.

00:20:58.400 --> 00:21:02.610
You have been so loyal to me all this time,

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:07.910
yet now you defy me and take the side 
of this inexperienced apprentice?

00:21:08.420 --> 00:21:10.690
I am a Knight-sorcerer!

00:21:10.690 --> 00:21:12.540
That means I will raise my sword

00:21:12.540 --> 00:21:15.710
against anyone who threatens the people, 
no matter who!

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:17.920
Lord Brangoire...

00:21:38.180 --> 00:21:40.690
Y-Your Highness!

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:42.570
Your injuries...

00:21:42.570 --> 00:21:44.940
I-It's the enemy!

00:21:45.820 --> 00:21:49.320
The Inquisition is attacking!

00:22:01.550 --> 00:22:05.470
Through a beautiful war 
with the Knights-sorcerers,

00:22:05.470 --> 00:22:07.970
we will rebuild relations.

00:22:07.970 --> 00:22:12.640
On my beard, 
I could not be more delighted!

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:17.470
It is just like reuniting 
with long-lost family!

00:22:21.990 --> 00:22:23.870
You got that right.

00:22:23.870 --> 00:22:28.090
Time for a reunion with my long-lost family.

00:22:25.990 --> 00:22:29.990
To Be Continued

00:24:00.000 --> 00:24:20.700
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:03.760
<i>The Inquisition has begun their invasion.</i>

00:24:03.760 --> 00:24:07.230
<i>Queen Boudica swears to resist them 
to the bitter end.</i>

00:24:07.230 --> 00:24:10.010
<i>Meanwhile, Seth has infiltrated the castle</i>

00:24:10.010 --> 00:24:12.370
<i>and runs into Diabal again.</i>

00:24:12.370 --> 00:24:15.350
<i>He is then told the secret of Piodon.</i>

00:24:15.810 --> 00:24:18.150
<i>Just who are these two men?</i>

00:24:18.150 --> 00:24:20.020
<i>And who is Seth?</i>

00:24:20.580 --> 00:24:24.030
<i>Next time on <i>Radiant</i>, 
"The Final Battlefield."</i>

00:24:20.700 --> 00:24:25.020
<b>The Final Battlefield 
-Battlefield-</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>I bought some great stuff
 to rebuild the shop!</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>Dad, someone covered in wounds
 just flew by...</b>

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:30.250
<b>End</b>
